├── MASTER-SETUP.md         # Global boot instructions and environment overview
├── ADAPTOID-ENGINE.md      # Adapter logic (Project Intent + Problem Adapter)
├── PROJECT-INTENT.md       # Current project goals, requirements, constraints
├── VERIFICATION-PROTOCOLS.md # Anti-hallucination and audit rules
├── MEMORY/                 # Persistent memory files 
│   ├── DAILY-LOGS/        # Session logs: memory/YYYY-MM-DD-HHMM.md
│   ├── MEMORY.md          # Curated long-term memory (distilled facts)
│   └── KNOWLEDGE-BASE/    # Structured vault (guides, profiles, domain corpora)
