Hackathon Demo: A sample machine learning project (e.g. “Train an image classifier for plant leaves”). Shows a pipeline from data collection agents to model training, evaluation, and a web UI, with memory of hyperparameters. Demonstrates verification (auto-checking model accuracy) and final artifact export.
Enterprise Automation: A multi-step workflow (e.g. “Automate expense report processing”) with parallel OCR agents, a human approval gate, and integration with a simulated ERP via MCP API. Emphasizes compliance logging.
