| **Provider-Agnostic Routing** | A dynamic module that selects the optimal LLM provider and model for each task based on cost, performance requirements, and task type. Implements model cascading/routing. | Addresses token economics challenges [[17]]; concept used in advanced systems like Ultra-Dex [[31]]. Enables cost-aware execution. |
